"deadman\nThe deadman watchdog is off. A payload that hangs will hang the board\nwith it, and getting out of that means a reset or the mains.\n  Type deadman <seconds> to arm it and deadman off to disarm it. The\n  seconds are decimal and whole.\n  The counter behind it is 20 bits wide and counts 65536 times a\n  second, so a fraction under 16 seconds is the longest it can be set\n  to. Anything larger is cut down to 15 rather than 16, because a\n  deadman that fires SOONER than it promised is a trap and one that\n  fires later is merely patient.\npmf> "